<title>EGYPT: Upper Egypt Flour Mills Q3 96/7 results.</title>
<headline>Upper Egypt Flour Mills Q3 96/7 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the third quarter of the 1996/7 financial year which ended June 30. (All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available)</p>
<p>July 1, 1996-March 31, 1997</p>
<p>Net sales 160,135,000</p>
<p>Production costs 143,388,000</p>
<p>Overheads	   6,261,000</p>
<p>Exceptional revenues   7,541,000</p>
<p>Net profit before tax  18,027,000</p>
<p>Full company name is Upper Egypt Flour Mills.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
